OL,3,GNEWSAMonths-long wait for rat
OL,4,Ainfestation call outs
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Coventry are having to
OL,7,Fwait three months for rat infestations
OL,8,Fto be tackled.
OL,10,FCouncillor Patricia Hetherton said
OL,11,Fthere were currently 437 outstanding
OL,12,Fpest control cases, with residents
OL,13,Fwaiting around 12 weeks on average for
OL,14,Ftreatment.
OL,16,FThe issue was raised by Wainbody
OL,17,Fcouncillor Mattie Heaven who said one
OL,18,Fof her constituents on St Martin's Road
OL,19,Fin Finham had been dealing with an
OL,20,Finfestation for over six months and it
OL,21,Fhad not been resolved.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
