OL,3,GNEWSAMonths-long wait for rat
OL,4,Ainfestation call outs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdditional funding had been allocated
OL,7,Fto the pest control service, Hetherton
OL,8,Fsaid, and recruitment was underway to
OL,9,F"increase staffing levels, strengthen
OL,10,Foperational capacity and improve
OL,11,Fresponse times for residents."
